error[elab/function-argument-signature-mismatch]: passed function `h` must have the same signature as function parameter `f`
  ┌─ elab/type-funarg-signature-mismatch.watsup:6:21
  │
1 │ dec $h(text) : nat
  │      -- passed function declared here
2 │ 
3 │ dec $caller(def $f(nat) : nat) : nat
  │                  -- function parameter declared here
4 │ 
5 │ dec $main : nat
  │             --- return value of function '$main' expects 'nat'
6 │ def $main = $caller(def $h)
  │                     ^^^^^^
  │
  = A passed function must have the same number of type parameters, parameter types, and return type as its function parameter.

